{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_01",
      "hash": "61867d565a832009",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "寶可夢似乎\\n睡得很香的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_02",
      "hash": "61867a565a831af0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要使用寶可夢之笛嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_03",
      "hash": "61867b565a831ca3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\n使用了寶可夢之笛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_04",
      "hash": "618680565a832522",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比獸醒來了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_07",
      "hash": "61867f565a83236f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比獸看著[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……\\n流下了口水！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_01",
      "hash": "dd4ceab8a4c8f45a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_02",
      "hash": "dd4ce9b8a4c8f2a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "富士「我把寶可夢之笛\\n交給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的時候，\\r\\n忘了告訴[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一件事……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_03",
      "hash": "dd4ce8b8a4c8f0f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀，\\n來得正是時候。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_05",
      "hash": "dd4ce6b8a4c8ed8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這隻叫卡比獸的寶可夢，\\c\\n有時會把醒來後第一眼\\n看到的東西誤認為是食物，\\r\\n然後襲擊對方。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_06",
      "hash": "dd4ce5b8a4c8ebdb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是變成那樣是很危險的，\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳透過寶可夢對戰\\r\\n讓牠冷靜下來吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_07",
      "hash": "dd4ce4b8a4c8ea28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "牠被打倒以後就會冷靜下來，\\n然後[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就可以像平常一樣捕捉牠了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_06",
      "hash": "61867e565a8321bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "睡糊塗的卡比獸\\n襲擊了過來！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_05",
      "hash": "618681565a8326d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比獸冷靜了下來。\\n牠打了個大哈欠之後……\\r\\n就走到深山裡去了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_08",
      "hash": "dd4ce3b8a4c8e875",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "富士「噢，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n幹得漂亮！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_09",
      "hash": "dd4ce2b8a4c8e6c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "富士「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n真可惜啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_10",
      "hash": "dd4965b8a4c5dc84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "就像剛剛的卡比獸一樣，\\n有的寶可夢會主動\\r\\n對訓練家發動襲擊。\\c\\n下次再遇到這種寶可夢的時候，\\n要記得先打倒再捕捉！\\c\\n明白了嗎？\\n先打倒再捕捉啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_11",
      "hash": "dd4966b8a4c5de37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那我就告辭了！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_020_max",
      "hash": "af6dc9a4f7b39c54"
    }
  ]
}
